-- ControllerCam HUD: what the fish journal has to say.
-- A few lines about each water (by the game's map number) and about some of the fish in it (by item number).
-- A water's lines are shown once you have landed something there, a fish's once you have landed one. They are
-- written for this journal and are for fun, and translated like every other text of the HUD. A fish's lines do
-- not name it: the journal shows its name above them, in the game's own words. A water or a fish without
-- lines simply has none.

local ADDON, ns = ...
local L = ns.L

ns.FishLore = {
